/* ===== Essay Quest v8 — CREATURES: every ordinary monster, mini-boss and land boss rebuilt as a smooth, jointed model.
   Archetypes: quad (four legs, each with hip, knee and ankle), biped (shoulders, elbows, hips, knees, a neck), dragon (one to eight
   necks, membrane wings, spined tail), serpent, flyer, arthropod and spirit. Each monster key picks an archetype and a few features.
   Every model faces +Z, stands on y = 0 and lists its joints so KIT.tick can sway them (necks weave, tails swish, wings beat). ===== */
